# The classical Theorem B for every `d` (module L7): definitions
Paper: `CGLMP/paper-classical-all-d/main.tex`, Sections 3-4 (Lemma `lem:cot`, Theorem A and its proof).

This file only fixes the objects shared by the files part `Classical*` of this file (no theorems of substance;
